[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19803.03, "timestamp": "05:30:03", "text": "最好去有茶的地方。我把那句话写了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19806.11, "timestamp": "05:30:06", "text": "那里有东西。希望我能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19814.948, "timestamp": "05:30:14", "text": "你就是斯温。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19833.628, "timestamp": "05:30:33", "text": "看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19854.35, "timestamp": "05:30:54", "text": "然后我知道的是，我会努力让自己挨饿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19858.948, "timestamp": "05:30:58", "text": "几天时间，看看我能不能活多久。"}]